  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Skip to content Astromax Work Services Studio Journal Contact Overview Menu Astromax Close Work Services Studio Journal Contact Overview Coleman Industry Sport Year 2025 Services Identity, Websites, Photography, Motion A strength gym that wanted to look like a place to train, not a place to sell memberships. Creative direction Pau Vidal Photography Ingrid Halvorsen Development Marta Soler Coleman coaches small groups in a converted warehouse. Their old site was full of discounts and stock photos of people smiling at machines. We photographed the members during real sessions, set the type heavy and plain, and moved the timetable to the front. Next Gerstner New projects [email protected] Barcelona, --:-- Carrer de la Diputaci\u00f3 214 08011 Barcelona Copenhagen, --:-- Vesterbrogade 88 1620 Copenhagen Work Services Studio Journal Contact Astromax \u00a9 2026 Astromax Privacy Terms",
